{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3929118625ca0ea3","name":"The Vipers","source":{"id":"source:reference-3929118625ca0ea3","title":"The Vipers","revision":21809,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:31:40Z","sha256":"99e9b52487611d4cc1de3d720830d7ba8b2e87d0bc5d11149269537cdca574bc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21809","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Vipers&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3929118625ca0ea3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["A Wretched Hive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/A_Wretched_Hive","referenceId":"reference:499e9f32005279b4"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Vipers, a rough gang of thugs who terrorize Zarra on a daily basis, always look for fresh prey. The swoop gang's leader is a violent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," woman named ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kessra"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kessra","referenceId":"reference:dcd8a00d48b6083b"},". She is the only female member of the gang, but she bears the scars of several past battles. From The Vipers' demeanor, it is clear that they follow her unquestioningly. However, they don't realize that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kessra"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kessra","referenceId":"reference:dcd8a00d48b6083b"}," sometimes takes small jobs from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darga the Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darga_the_Hutt","referenceId":"reference:cf39a7b12acc3031"},". She uses her gang to achieve the crime lord's goals in Zarra.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Kessra"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kessra","referenceId":"reference:dcd8a00d48b6083b"}," built the gang out of a band of former Separatist mercenaries who were stranded on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cato Neimoidia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cato_Neimoidia","referenceId":"reference:6720e9092ebc841e"}," after the end of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},". Rather than be taken captive by the newly formed Empire, Kessra led her mercenaries into hiding under the guise of being a swoop gang. After a while, Kessra realized that her Vipers could live well on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cato Neimoidia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cato_Neimoidia","referenceId":"reference:6720e9092ebc841e"},", and they took over the streets of Zarra. When newcomers arrive, she makes sure that The Vipers are there to demonstrate who runs the show in the city.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All members of The Vipers have their own ",{"tag":"a","children":["Viper Swoop Bikes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Viper_Swoop_Bikes"},", which they ride into battle. Though they do not have weapons on their bikes- ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," wouldn’t allow such a blatant flaunting of the law, even on a world so lightly occupied- each of The Vipers carry personal weapons (usually ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibroblades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibroblades"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistols"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Vipers Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Viper Swoop Gang Member"],"href":"http